@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+## Why
+
+The school wants to reward customers who stay longer. A rental of 3 days or more should cost less than its full price.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- A rental of 3 or more days is priced at 90% of its full price (daily price times days).
+- The reduced total appears on both quotes and bookings.
+- Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+- `rental`: the Quote requirement (and the Booking total that follows from it) gains the long-stay discount.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/index.ts`: the shared pricing step used by `quote` and `book`.
+- `test/rental.test.ts`: the 3-day quote expectation changes from 7500 to 6750.
+- Assumption: a discounted total that is not a whole number of cents is rounded to the nearest cent, halves rounding up, so money stays an integer.
